      "writtenOn": "2025-07-29T23:12:14Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes, our input to this method is that request_ready_nodes is a list of nodes which can be used by at least one provider.\n\nHere we need to know which provider so we can get the count.\n\nIf we had a more complex data structure, we could do this in the earlier check and keep the data.  But these checks shouldn\u0027t be that expensive, so in the interest of keeping things simple for now, I\u0027m repeating it.\n\nIt\u0027s probably worth moving it in a future change.",
